      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AT SCALE\nTHE CASCADE\n\n7T+ msgs/day\n\nCount ≠ load.\nHot partitions land\non the same task.\n\nLatency spike →\nmonitor fires rebalance\n→ dest. cluster already\nstrained → triggers\nANOTHER rebalance.\n\nThe fixer amplifies\nthe problem.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AT SCALE\nTHE CASCADE\n\n7T+ msgs/day\n\nCount ≠ load.\nHot partitions land\non the same task.\n\nLatency spike →\nmonitor fires rebalance\n→ dest. cluster already\nstrained → triggers\nANOTHER rebalance.\n\nThe fixer amplifies\nthe problem.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
